          <div class="pt-1">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center bg-white/10 text-amber-200 border border-amber-400/30 text-[12px] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-md">
              Beli 2 Lebih Hemat (Hanya Rp168.500) + BISA COD
